{"initializationAction":["(q.player.data.bobi_defeated < 1) ? q.dialogue.set_page('Dialogo');",
  "(q.player.data.bobi_defeated >= 1) ? q.dialogue.close();"],"speakers":{"npc":{"name":{"type":"expression","expression":"q.npc.name"},"face":"q.npc.face()"},"player":{"name":{"type":"expression","expression":"q.player.username"},"face":"q.player.face()"}},"pages":[{"id":"Dialogo","speaker":"npc","lines":[{"type":"expression","expression":"'Te estaba esperando'"}]},{"id":"Dialogo","speaker":"npc","lines":[{"type":"expression","expression":"'Seguro te suena familiar lo que tengo atrás mio'"}]},{"id":"Dialogo","speaker":"npc","lines":[{"type":"expression","expression":"'En efecto, es la maquina del tiempo que está en Pueblo Azalea, solo que un poco deteriorada'"}]},{"id":"Dialogo","speaker":"npc","lines":[{"type":"expression","expression":"'El Bobi actual la usa mucho para viajar entre la isla y el overworld'"}]},{"id":"Dialogo","speaker":"npc","lines":[{"type":"expression","expression":"'Esto puede provocar alguna anomalía'"}]},{"id":"Dialogo","speaker":"npc","lines":[{"type":"expression","expression":"'Por eso, yo me encargo de proteger al mundo de lo que pueda llegar a pasar'"}]},{"id":"Dialogo","speaker":"npc","lines":[{"type":"expression","expression":"'Pero ya te di mucha charla'"}]},{"id":"despedida","speaker":"npc","lines":[{"type":"expression","expression":"'Ahora dejame ver el poder de los estudiantes de la academia'"}],"input":"q.dialogue.close(); v.battle = q.npc.start_battle(q.player);"},{"id":"on_cooldown","speaker":"npc","lines":[{"type":"expression","expression":"'Este npc le quedan ' + q.run_script('cobblemon:cooldown_remaining_time') + ' de cooldown'"}]}]}